<title>FRANCE: HORSE RACING-HELISSIO WINS ARC.</title>
<headline>HORSE RACING-HELISSIO WINS ARC.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-10-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Helissio, ridden by Olivier Peslier, won the Prix de l'Arc de Triomphe horse race at Longchamp on Sunday.</p>
